  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/mod-titles/more-chest-variants.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsA42pp6cuX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@lieonlion?sub_confirmation=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/youtube.svg\" alt=\"youtube\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/LieOnLion/More-Chest-Variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fLieOnLion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lieonlion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/LieOnLion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/patreon.svg\" alt=\"patreon\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieon-studios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/a-creation-by-lieon-studio.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/all-of-fabric-7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/featured-in-aof7.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fquad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/requires-quad.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h3>新增極其需要的更多儲物箱變種。</h3><p>現在每種木材都有專屬的儲物箱，讓你的建築充滿多彩的儲存空間。獨特的設計確保預設儲物箱不再破壞你的風格。</p><p><img src=\"https://lieonstudios.github.io/assets/v3/project/mod/more-chest-variants/banner/chest-set.png\" alt=\"chest-set\"></p><h3>以最原汁原味的方式為 Minecraft 新增儲物箱。</h3><p>透過 <strong>Quad</strong> 支援新增：</p><ul>\n<li>儲物箱可在熔爐中作為燃料燃燒（地獄木材除外）</li>\n<li>地獄木材儲物箱免疫火焰/岩漿</li>\n<li>任何儲物箱皆可用於原版配方（例如漏斗）</li>\n<li><strong>即將推出</strong> - 自然生成結構中出現儲物箱（Quad 1.3.0-beta.1 及以上版本）</li>\n</ul><h2>星際大戰日</h2><p>更多儲物箱變種於 2023 年 5 月 4 日發布。因此，從 5 月 3 日至 5 月 5 日，你的儲物箱將呈現特殊的星際大戰紋理。願原力與大家同在。</p><h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chested-companions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chested Companions</a></h2><p>想讓你的寵物攜帶小型儲物箱嗎？現在透過 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chested-companions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chested Companions</a> 與更多儲物箱變種的支援，牠們可以攜帶你最喜愛木材類型的儲物箱！</p><h2>第一週年</h2><p>更多儲物箱變種已於 2024 年 5 月 4 日迎來一週年。在這第一年中，它在 Curseforge 上達到 28.2 萬次下載，Modrinth 上達到 9.3 萬次，總計 <strong>37.5 萬</strong> 次下載 :O。同時也加入 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/all-of-fabric-7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AOF7</a>。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisect.lieonlion.dev%252fcurseforge%252fmcv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/banners/bisect-banner-spruce-chest.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p>",
